  "content": "\n    <h3 id=\"audio-art\">Audio Art</h3>\n\n<p>Eduardo Kac: Aspects of the Aesthetics of Telecommunications  <br>\n<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.ekac.org/telecom.paper.siggrap.html\"  aria-label=\"http://www.ekac.org/Telecom.Paper.Siggrap.html (opens in a new tab)\"  >http://www.ekac.org/Telecom.Paper.Siggrap.html</a></p>\n<p>Intermedium 2, ZKM Karlsruhe, Germany &ndash;(March 22-28)  </p>\n<p>Walter Ruttmann: Weekend - Info  <br>\n<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://sfsound.org/tape/ruttmann.html\"  aria-label=\"http://sfsound.org/tape/ruttmann.html (opens in a new tab)\"  >http://sfsound.org/tape/ruttmann.html</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"games\">Games</h3>\n\n<p>Complete Freedom of Movement  <br>\n&ldquo;<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://web.mit.edu/~21fms/People/henry3/complete.html\"  aria-label=\"&amp;lsquo;Complete Freedom of Movement&amp;rsquo;: Video Games as Gendered Play Spaces (opens in a new tab)\"  >&lsquo;Complete Freedom of Movement&rsquo;: Video Games as Gendered Play Spaces</a>&rdquo;  <br>\nBy Henry Jenkins </p>\n<p>Interactive Audiences  <br>\n&ldquo;Interactive Audiences? The &lsquo;Collective Intelligence&rsquo; of Media Fans&rdquo;  <br>\nBy Henry Jenkins </p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"hypertext-fiction\">Hypertext Fiction</h3>\n\n<p>Adaweb  <br>\n<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://adaweb.walkerart.org/\"  aria-label=\"http://adaweb.walkerart.org/ (opens in a new tab)\"  >http://adaweb.walkerart.org/</a></p>\n<p>Alt-X  <br>\n<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.altx.com/\"  aria-label=\"http://www.altx.com/ (opens in a new tab)\"  >http://www.altx.com/</a></p>\n<p>Artnetweb</p>\n<p>Dichtung Digital (English)  <br>\nEditor: Roberto Simanowski  <br>\n<a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.dichtung-digital.com/english.htm\"  aria-label=\"http://www.dic